   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marketing/Storage/Processing: Rural Families&apos; Productive Inclusion and Resilience Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&#xBF;s Goal is that &#xBF;the project&apos;s investments contribute to promoting income-generating activities and the food and nutritional security of rural families&#xBF;. The Project&#xBF;s Development Objective is that &#xBF;Beneficiary families have increased their access to markets and their resilience to economic and climate-related shocks&#xBF;.Climate ChangeRural Enterprise and Employment Opportunities</narrative>
  </description>
